function renderTemplate(template:string,lead:any){return String(template||'').replaceAll('{{name}}',String(lead?.name||'there')).replaceAll('{{email}}',String(lead?.email||'')).replaceAll('{{phone}}',String(lead?.phone||''));}
async function runWorkflowStep(db:any,run:any){
 const steps=Array.isArray(run.steps)?run.steps:[];const index=Number(run.current_step||0);
 if(index>=steps.length){await db.from('growth_workflow_runs').update({status:'succeeded',completed_at:new Date().toISOString(),locked_at:null,claim_token:null,last_error:null,updated_at:new Date().toISOString()}).eq('id',run.id).eq('organization_id',run.organization_id).eq('claim_token',run.claim_token);return {id:run.id,status:'succeeded'};}
 if(index===0)await assertQuota(db,run.organization_id,'workflow_runs',`workflow-run:${run.id}`);
 const step=steps[index],{data:lead}=run.lead_id?await db.from('growth_leads').select('id,name,email,phone,consent_to_contact,contact_opted_out_at,channel_consents,channel_suppressions,lead_temperature,status,source').eq('id',run.lead_id).eq('organization_id',run.organization_id).maybeSingle():{data:null};
 await db.from('growth_workflow_run_events').insert({organization_id:run.organization_id,run_id:run.id,rule_id:run.rule_id,step_index:index,event_type:index===0?'run_started':'step_started',details:{step_type:String(step.type||'unknown')}});
 if(step.type==='condition'){
  if(!lead)throw new Error('Workflow condition requires an existing lead.');
  const evaluate=(expression:any):boolean=>{
   if(Array.isArray(expression?.conditions)){
    const results=expression.conditions.map((child:any)=>evaluate(child));
    return expression.combinator==='any'?results.some(Boolean):results.every(Boolean);
   }
   const actual=String(lead[expression?.field]??'').toLowerCase(),expected=String(expression?.value??'').toLowerCase();
   return expression?.operator==='equals'?actual===expected:expression?.operator==='not_equals'?actual!==expected:actual.includes(expected);
  };
  const matched=evaluate(step.expression||{field:step.field,operator:step.operator,value:step.value});
  const next=Math.min(steps.length,index+1+(matched?0:Number(step.skip_steps||1))),done=next>=steps.length;
  await db.from('growth_workflow_run_events').insert({organization_id:run.organization_id,run_id:run.id,rule_id:run.rule_id,step_index:index,event_type:matched?'step_succeeded':'step_skipped',details:{condition_field:step.field,matched,next_step:next}});
  await db.from('growth_workflow_runs').update({current_step:next,status:done?'succeeded':'queued',next_run_at:new Date().toISOString(),locked_at:null,claim_token:null,attempts:0,completed_at:done?new Date().toISOString():null,last_error:null,updated_at:new Date().toISOString()}).eq('id',run.id).eq('organization_id',run.organization_id).eq('claim_token',run.claim_token);
  if(done)await db.from('growth_workflow_run_events').insert({organization_id:run.organization_id,run_id:run.id,rule_id:run.rule_id,event_type:'run_succeeded',details:{}});
  return {id:run.id,status:done?'succeeded':matched?'condition_matched':'condition_skipped',matched,nextStep:next};
 }
 if(step.type==='wait'){
  const next=index+1,done=next>=steps.length;await db.from('growth_workflow_run_events').insert({organization_id:run.organization_id,run_id:run.id,rule_id:run.rule_id,step_index:index,event_type:'step_waiting',details:{delay_minutes:Number(step.delay_minutes)||1}});await db.from('growth_workflow_runs').update({current_step:next,status:done?'succeeded':'queued',next_run_at:new Date(Date.now()+Math.min(10080,Math.max(1,Number(step.delay_minutes)||1))*60000).toISOString(),locked_at:null,claim_token:null,attempts:0,completed_at:done?new Date().toISOString():null,last_error:null,updated_at:new Date().toISOString()}).eq('id',run.id).eq('organization_id',run.organization_id).eq('claim_token',run.claim_token);if(done)await db.from('growth_workflow_run_events').insert({organization_id:run.organization_id,run_id:run.id,rule_id:run.rule_id,event_type:'run_succeeded',details:{}});return {id:run.id,status:done?'succeeded':'waiting'};
 }
 if(step.type==='create_follow_up'){
  if(!lead)throw new Error('Workflow lead no longer exists.');
  const {error}=await db.from('growth_tasks').upsert({organization_id:run.organization_id,lead_id:lead.id,title:renderTemplate(step.title||'Follow up with {{name}}',lead).slice(0,160),description:renderTemplate(step.description||'Workflow follow-up',lead).slice(0,1000),task_type:'follow_up',created_by:null,workflow_step_key:`workflow:${run.id}:${index}`},{onConflict:'organization_id,workflow_step_key',ignoreDuplicates:true});if(error)throw error;
 }else if(step.type==='notify_admin'){
  if(!lead)throw new Error('Workflow lead no longer exists.');
  const {error}=await db.from('growth_tasks').upsert({organization_id:run.organization_id,lead_id:lead.id,title:`Review new lead: ${lead.name}`.slice(0,160),description:'A new lead needs review from the workflow engine.',task_type:'review',created_by:null,workflow_step_key:`workflow:${run.id}:${index}`},{onConflict:'organization_id,workflow_step_key',ignoreDuplicates:true});if(error)throw error;
 }else if(step.type==='queue_whatsapp_template'){
  if(!lead?.consent_to_contact||lead.contact_opted_out_at)throw new Error('WhatsApp template workflow blocked: active consent is missing or contact opted out.');
  const {data:template}=await db.from('growth_whatsapp_templates').select('id,approval_status,variables').eq('id',step.template_id).eq('organization_id',run.organization_id).maybeSingle();
  if(!template||template.approval_status!=='approved')throw new Error('Selected WhatsApp template is not approved.');
  const values=(template.variables||[]).map((v:string)=>renderTemplate(v,lead));
  const {error}=await db.from('growth_jobs').upsert({organization_id:run.organization_id,job_type:'send_whatsapp_template',idempotency_key:`workflow:${run.id}:${index}`,payload:{lead_id:lead.id,template_id:template.id,values,workflow_run_id:run.id,workflow_step_index:index},run_at:new Date().toISOString()},{onConflict:'organization_id,job_type,idempotency_key',ignoreDuplicates:true});if(error)throw error;
 }else if(step.type==='send_sms'){
  if(!lead?.phone||!lead.consent_to_contact||lead.contact_opted_out_at||lead.channel_consents?.sms?.granted!==true||lead.channel_suppressions?.sms?.suppressed===true)throw new Error('SMS workflow blocked: explicit SMS channel consent and no suppression are required.');
  const integration=await getWorkspaceIntegration(db,run.organization_id,'twilio');const from=String(integration.settings.from_number||'');if(!integration.credentials.account_sid||!integration.credentials.auth_token||!/^\+[1-9]\d{7,14}$/.test(from))throw new Error('Twilio integration is not configured with an E.164 sender number.');
  if(!/^\+[1-9]\d{7,14}$/.test(String(lead.phone)))throw new Error('SMS workflow lead phone is not in E.164 format.');
  const requestId=`workflow:${run.id}:${index}`;
  let {data:sms}=await db.from('growth_sms_messages').select('id,status').eq('organization_id',run.organization_id).eq('client_request_id',requestId).maybeSingle();
  if(!sms){const {data:created,error}=await db.from('growth_sms_messages').insert({organization_id:run.organization_id,lead_id:lead.id,initiated_by:null,to_phone:lead.phone,from_sender:from,body:renderTemplate(step.message_template,lead).slice(0,1500),status:'queued',provider_status:'queued',consent_verified_at:new Date().toISOString(),client_request_id:requestId,direction:'outbound'}).select('id,status').single();if(error||!created)throw error||new Error('Unable to create SMS workflow dispatch record.');sms=created;}
  const {data:existingJob}=await db.from('growth_jobs').select('id').eq('organization_id',run.organization_id).eq('job_type','send_sms').eq('idempotency_key',requestId).limit(1).maybeSingle();
  if(!existingJob&&!['accepted','sent','delivered'].includes(String(sms.status))){const {error}=await db.from('growth_jobs').upsert({organization_id:run.organization_id,job_type:'send_sms',idempotency_key:requestId,payload:{lead_id:lead.id,sms_message_id:sms.id,workflow_run_id:run.id,workflow_step_index:index},run_at:new Date().toISOString()},{onConflict:'organization_id,job_type,idempotency_key',ignoreDuplicates:true});if(error)throw error;}
 }else if(step.type==='queue_whatsapp'||step.type==='send_email'){
  if(!lead?.consent_to_contact||lead.contact_opted_out_at)throw new Error('Outbound message skipped: active explicit consent is missing or contact opted out.');
  const destination=step.type==='queue_whatsapp'?lead.phone:lead.email;if(!destination)throw new Error(`Lead has no ${step.type==='queue_whatsapp'?'phone number':'email address'}.`);
  const payload=step.type==='queue_whatsapp'?{lead_id:lead.id,message:renderTemplate(step.message_template,lead)}:{lead_id:lead.id,subject:renderTemplate(step.subject,lead),text:renderTemplate(step.text_template,lead)};
  const {error}=await db.from('growth_jobs').upsert({organization_id:run.organization_id,job_type:step.type==='queue_whatsapp'?'send_whatsapp':'send_email',idempotency_key:`workflow:${run.id}:${index}`,payload:{...payload,workflow_run_id:run.id,workflow_step_index:index},run_at:new Date().toISOString()},{onConflict:'organization_id,job_type,idempotency_key',ignoreDuplicates:true});if(error)throw error;
 }else throw new Error(`Unsupported workflow step: ${String(step.type)}`);
 const next=index+1,done=next>=steps.length;await db.from('growth_workflow_run_events').insert({organization_id:run.organization_id,run_id:run.id,rule_id:run.rule_id,step_index:index,event_type:'step_succeeded',details:{step_type:step.type}});await db.from('growth_workflow_runs').update({current_step:next,status:done?'succeeded':'queued',next_run_at:new Date().toISOString(),locked_at:null,claim_token:null,attempts:0,completed_at:done?new Date().toISOString():null,last_error:null,updated_at:new Date().toISOString()}).eq('id',run.id).eq('organization_id',run.organization_id).eq('claim_token',run.claim_token);if(done)await db.from('growth_workflow_run_events').insert({organization_id:run.organization_id,run_id:run.id,rule_id:run.rule_id,event_type:'run_succeeded',details:{}});return {id:run.id,status:done?'succeeded':'continued'};
}
async function processWorkflowRuns(db:any){
 const {data:runs,error}=await db.rpc('claim_due_growth_workflow_runs',{batch_limit:10});if(error)throw error;const results=[];
 for(const run of runs||[]){try{const {data:tenant}=await db.from('growth_organizations').select('status').eq('id',run.organization_id).maybeSingle();if(tenant?.status!=='active'){await db.from('growth_workflow_runs').update({status:'queued',locked_at:null,next_run_at:new Date(Date.now()+30*60*1000).toISOString(),last_error:'Workspace is suspended; execution paused.'}).eq('id',run.id).eq('organization_id',run.organization_id).eq('claim_token',run.claim_token);results.push({id:run.id,status:'paused_tenant'});continue;}results.push(await runWorkflowStep(db,run));}catch(e){const msg=e instanceof Error?e.message:'Workflow step failed';const terminal=Number(run.attempts||0)>=Number(run.max_attempts||5);await db.from('growth_workflow_run_events').insert({organization_id:run.organization_id,run_id:run.id,rule_id:run.rule_id,step_index:Number(run.current_step||0),event_type:'step_failed',details:{message:msg.slice(0,1000),terminal}});if(terminal)await db.from('growth_workflow_run_events').insert({organization_id:run.organization_id,run_id:run.id,rule_id:run.rule_id,event_type:'run_failed',details:{message:msg.slice(0,1000)}});if(terminal)await db.from('growth_workflow_dead_letters').upsert({organization_id:run.organization_id,run_id:run.id,rule_id:run.rule_id,lead_id:run.lead_id||null,error_message:msg.slice(0,2000),attempts:Number(run.attempts||0),failed_at:new Date().toISOString(),status:'open',updated_at:new Date().toISOString()},{onConflict:'run_id'});await db.from('growth_workflow_runs').update({status:terminal?'failed':'queued',last_error:msg,locked_at:null,claim_token:null,next_run_at:new Date(Date.now()+Math.min(60,Math.pow(2,Math.max(0,Number(run.attempts||1)-1)))*60000).toISOString(),updated_at:new Date().toISOString()}).eq('id',run.id).eq('organization_id',run.organization_id).eq('claim_token',run.claim_token);results.push({id:run.id,status:terminal?'failed':'retry',error:msg});}}
 return results;
}


